只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Auxiliary models for DeepSeek Harness: vision understanding and context compression through dedicated model routes. DeepSeek Harness 辅助模型插件：为视觉理解、上下文压缩、审批审查、子代理、会话标题与图片生成提供独立的模型路由、工具与系统提示，全程不触碰主对话模型。","id":"gh:1333825220","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-auxiliary","slug":"dsh-plugins/dsh-auxiliary","topics":["approval","context-compression","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","router","routes","subagent","subagents","title-generation","title-generator","vision"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Auxiliary models for DeepSeek Harness: vision understanding and context compression through dedicate"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d model routes. DeepSeek Harness 辅助模型插件：为视觉理解、上下文压缩、审批审查、子代理、会话标题与图片生成提供独立的模型路由、工具与系统提示，全程不触碰主对话模型。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-auxiliary"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Auxiliary models for DeepSeek Harness — dedicated model routes, tools, and system guidance for vis"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ion, compaction, reviews, titles, and image generation, without touching the main conversation model"},{"id":"p3s3","text":", compaction, reviews, titles, and image generation, without touching the main conversation model.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-auxiliary` is a DeepSeek Harness plugin that layers auxiliary-model capabilities on the harness"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" LLM seam (`ctx.llm`). It never replaces the main conversation model: each feature is an independent"},{"id":"p5s3","text":", optional route that kicks in only for its own narrow call category, so you can give expensive or s"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"pecialized work (vision, compaction summaries, approval reviews, session titles, image generation) i"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ts own cheap or capable model."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Feature overview"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Feature | What it does | Where to configure |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Vision understanding | `inspect_image` tool: read a local image and ask a vision model about it | "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"Plugin configuration → **Vision understanding** |\n| Image handoff | Chat images survive a text-only "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"main model via `describe_image` | Vision understanding card → **Image handoff** |\n| Context compacti"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"on | Summaries (`purpose: 'compaction'`) use a dedicated model | Plugin configuration → **Context co"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"mpaction** |\n| Compression engine *(optional)* | Replaces the compaction backend with an explicit co"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"mpression prompt | `engine.enabled` in the config |\n| Approval model | Reviews from @dsh-plugin/dsh-"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"approve-for-me use a dedicated model | Plugin configuration → **Approval model** |\n| Title model | S"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ession titles (`purpose: 'session-title'`) use a dedicated model | Plugin configuration → **Title mo"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"del** |\n| Image-generation model | `generate_image` tool: create images through an OpenAI-compatible"},{"id":"p8s10","text":" images API | Plugin configuration → **Image-generation model** |\n| Model capability marks | Checkbo"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"xes on your own `llm-pi-ai` models: version-gated **Allow image input** / **Allow image generation**"},{"id":"p8s12","text":" | Models page → provider → customized settings → model |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"All routes are configured in **the loader-managed plugin configuration** (rendered by loader) and ta"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ke effect immediately on save — no restart, no rebuild of the conversation."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Copy the block below and paste it to your DSH agent (the assistant in this web\nGUI). The agent perfo"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"rms the install and verification for you — no manual npm\nor profile editing needed:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then open **the loader-managed plugin configuration** in the web UI to configure the\nroutes, and mar"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"k the models you want to use in **Settings → Models**."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Features in detail"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Vision understanding and `inspect_image`"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Configure a provider/model in the **Models** page first, then pick the pair under **Vision understan"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ding** (saved as `vision.provider` + `vision.model`). `tool.enabled` independently controls whether "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"the `inspect_image` tool is registered."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Once enabled, ask the agent to run `inspect_image` on a Host-readable path:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> Use inspect_image to analyze screenshots/error.png"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The tool commits the file through the `ctx.attachments` seam and asks the selected vision model, ret"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"urning a text answer (optionally truncated at `vision.maxTokens`). PNG, JPEG, WebP, and GIF are supp"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" a text answer (optionally truncated at `vision.maxTokens`). PNG, JPEG, WebP, and GIF are supported."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Model capability mark**: for a user-configured `llm-pi-ai` model, the **Allow image input** checkb"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ox in the model's settings writes its canonical `input` declaration (`[text, image]` when checked, `"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"[text]` when cleared). Both `inspect_image` and the main chat composer read that same capability fac"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"t. The declaration cannot add vision to a text-only model — only check it when the upstream endpoint"},{"id":"p21s5","text":" actually accepts images."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Image handoff (chat images with a text-only main model)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"When **Image handoff** (`vision.handoff`, default on) is enabled with a vision route selected, image"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" delivery is native-first and falls back safely for routes without declared image support:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. A runtime wrapper on `ctx.llm.resolveModelInfo` claims image input for text-only main routes whil"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e handoff is active, so the image admission preflight passes (the model catalog and per-model checkb"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"oxes are unaffected because they read the settings document directly). The configured auxiliary visi"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"on route is never inflated, so `inspect_image`/`describe_image` still reject a mistakenly selected t"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ext-only vision model.\n2. For each request containing images, a listener on the official `llm/stream"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"` waterfall checks the exact request's provider/model through the original capability resolver. Imag"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"e-capable routes receive the original `ImageBlock`s unchanged. Text-only routes and routes with unde"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"clared modalities receive durable text references such as `[image: {\"attachmentId\":…,\"mediaType\":…}]"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"`; nested images in tool results are rewritten too.\n3. The system prompt tells a text-only main mode"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"l to call `describe_image` with the exact JSON from the reference; the tool reads the stored attachm"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"ent bytes, asks the selected vision model, and returns a text description."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The rewrite is immutable and request-local, so concurrent native and fallback streams cannot affect "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"one another; aborts, errors, early iterator closure, and plugin disposal retain the host stream sema"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ntics. References are plain text and therefore survive restarts, forks, and replays. Both seams are "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"plugin-side; no core package is modified. Disable `vision.handoff` to restore the original admission"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" and stream behavior."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Skipping injection for vision-capable main models"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The plugin consumes dsh-loader 2.x facades. Config-api owns the form and persistence; model editor e"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"nhancements follow the host version in the loader boot description. Feature registrations are reconc"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"iled against each updated configuration snapshot."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
